flowchart TD
    JIRA([Jira Ticket]) --> ANALYST[Analyst<br/>refina el ticket]
    ANALYST -->|gaps de negocio| ASKHUMAN{{Comenta Jira<br/>espera humano}}
    ASKHUMAN -.respuesta.-> ANALYST
    ANALYST -->|refined-ticket.yaml| ARCH[Architect<br/>diseno + subtasks + riesgo]

    ARCH -->|tech-design.md + subtasks.yaml| GATEA{{GATE A<br/>Aprobacion humana de diseno}}
    GATEA -->|low-risk: fast lane| CODER
    GATEA -->|aprobado| CODER

    subgraph LOOP1[Loop rojo-verde  max 3]
        CODER[Coder<br/>ponytail + skill del stack] -->|diff| TESTER[Dev Tester<br/>escribe y CORRE pruebas]
        TESTER -->|fail + output| CODER
    end

    TESTER -->|pruebas verdes| REVIEWER[Architect Reviewer]
    REVIEWER -->|changes_requested max 2| CODER
    REVIEWER -->|approved: crea draft PR| GUARDIAN[Guardian<br/>Semgrep/Trivy/gitleaks + LLM]

    GUARDIAN -->|fail critico max 2| CODER
    GUARDIAN -->|pass| GATEB{{GATE B<br/>Merge humano}}
    GATEB --> DONE([Merged])

    LIB[Librarian<br/>PROJECT_CONTEXT.md] -.contexto.-> ANALYST
    LIB -.contexto.-> ARCH
    LIB -.contexto.-> CODER
    LIB -.contexto.-> REVIEWER
    LIB -.contexto.-> GUARDIAN

    HOOKS[[PreToolUse hooks<br/>guardrails de seguridad]] -.protege.-> CODER
    HOOKS -.protege.-> GUARDIAN
